  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A lightweight, noncomedogenic liquid illuminator for a sheer, natural glow under makeup, mixed in, or worn alone.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Light<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Radiant Natural Matte<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: Powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Olive-Derived Squalane: Locks in moisture and leaves skin quenched and visibly glowing.<br>- Rosehip Seed Oil: Ultra-rich in antioxidants to visibly brighten and moisturize skin.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Best for a no-makeup makeup look with glowy radiance, this award-winning liquid highlighter gives a</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Think of Glowy Super Gel&trade; as your forever first step for an effortless glow:<br>-Apply one to tweo pumps all over under your favorite foundation, tinted moisturizer, or other complexion products. <br>-Use fingertips or The Big Brush (sold separately) to blend in.<br><br>Glowy Super Gel&trade; is also a multipurpose illuminator:  <br>-Stacked on top of any look as a spot highlighter for instant glass-skin.<br>-Mixed into cream makeup or skincare formula to boost glow.<br>-Worn alone on the face or body (like your chest, collarbones, shoulders, and legs) for an all-over glow.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Plant-Derived Glycerin: Powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.</p><p>-Olive-Derived Squalane: Locks in moisture and leaves the skin quenched and visibly glowing.</p><p>-Rosehip Seed Oil: Ultra-rich in antioxidants to visibly brighten and moisturize skin.</p><p><br></p><p>Starglow, Sunglow, Roseglow, Beachglow:</p><p>Aqua /Water / Eau, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Propanediol, Glycerin, Mica, Squalane, Rosa Canina Fruit Oil, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polysorbate 60, Sorbitan Isostearate, Phenethyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Tocopherol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate, Lactic Acid. [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77499)].</p><p><br></p><p>Warmglow:</p><p>Aqua /Water / Eau, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Propanediol, Glycerin, Mica, Squalane, Rosa Canina Fruit Oil, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polysorbate 60, Sorbitan Isostearate, Phenethyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Tocopherol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate, Lactic Acid. [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491)].</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A lightweight, noncomedogenic liquid illuminator for a sheer, natural glow under makeup, mixed in, or worn alone.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Light<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Radiant Natural Matte<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: Powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Olive-Derived Squalane: Locks in moisture and leaves skin quenched and visibly glowing.<br>- Rosehip Seed Oil: Ultra-rich in antioxidants to visibly brighten and moisturize skin.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Best for a no-makeup makeup look with glowy radiance, this award-winning liquid highlighter gives a</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\">